examples:
Streaming resume token pattern: server returns 'Resume-Token' in stream metadata every N frames. Client should persist last-seen token and, on reconnect, include 'Resume-From: <token>' header to request continuation. Example pseudocode (TypeScript):

const stream = await client.chat.stream(req);
for await (const chunk of stream) {
  if (chunk.resumeToken) lastToken = chunk.resumeToken;
  process(chunk.data);
}

// On reconnect
const resumed = await client.chat.stream({ ...req, headers: { 'Resume-From': lastToken } });
